// ── TLS 1.2 vs TLS 1.3 comparison ────────────────────────────
//
// Feature               │ TLS 1.2               │ TLS 1.3
// ──────────────────────┼───────────────────────┼──────────────────────────
// Handshake RTTs        │ 2 RTT                 │ 1 RTT (0-RTT for resumed)
// Cipher suites         │ Hundreds (incl. weak) │ 5 (all AEAD + FS)
// Key exchange          │ RSA or ECDHE          │ ECDHE only (FS mandatory)
// Encryption of cert    │ No (cert in plaintext)│ Yes (cert encrypted)
// Deprecated features   │ Compression, renegot. │ Removed entirely
// Handshake encryption  │ Partial               │ Full (after ServerHello)

